<style xmlns="http://purl.org/net/xbiblio/csl" default-locale="en-US" version="1.0" class="in-text" initialize-with-hyphen="true" demote-non-dropping-particle="sort-only"><info><author><name>Pavel Giverts</name></author><category citation-format="numeric"/><category field="science"/><id>http://www.zotero.org/styles/council-of-science-editors-brackets</id><link href="http://www.zotero.org/styles/council-of-science-editors-brackets" rel="self"/><link href="http://www.zotero.org/styles/council-of-science-editors-brackets" rel="template"/><link href="http://www.scientificstyleandformat.org/Tools/SSF-Citation-Quick-Guide.html" rel="documentation"/><rights license="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License</rights><summary>The Council of Science Editors style 8th edition, Citation-Sequence system: numbers in text in brackets, sorted by order of appearance in text.</summary><title>Council of Science Editors, Citation-Sequence (numeric, brackets)</title><title-short>CSE C-S brackets</title-short><updated>2021-08-12T04:37:16+00:00</updated></info><citation disambiguate-add-givenname="false" givenname-disambiguation-rule="by-cite" disambiguate-add-names="false" disambiguate-add-year-suffix="false" collapse="citation-number" near-note-distance="5"><sort><key variable="citation-number" sort="ascending"/></sort><layout prefix="[" suffix="]" delimiter=", "><text variable="citation-number" form="long" quotes="false" strip-periods="false"/><group prefix="," delimiter=" "><label variable="locator" form="short" plural="contextual" strip-periods="true"/><text variable="locator" form="long" quotes="false" strip-periods="false"/></group></layout></citation><bibliography hanging-indent="false" second-field-align="margin" line-spacing="1" entry-spacing="1" subsequent-author-substitute-rule="complete-all" et-al-min="11" et-al-use-first="10"><layout><text variable="citation-number" form="long" prefix="["